Gospel Atlas — licences
=======================

This project combines application source code written by David Lee with
Scripture texts, a Gospel index and a cross-reference dataset published by
others. The code licence below covers the code only. Each body of data keeps
the licence it arrived with, and those licences travel with any copy you share.

Taken as a whole, the complete application may be shared free of charge for
NON-COMMERCIAL use, because the Composite Gospel Index is licensed CC BY-NC-SA
2.0. The reader's guide, GUIDE.md, carries the full notices, the adaptations
made to each source, and the source hashes recorded in the release audit.


1. Application source
---------------------

Covers src/, build.mjs, zipwriter.mjs, prepare_languages.py,
verify_release.py and test_functions.mjs.

