2. Composite Gospel Index 1.2 — CC BY-NC-SA 2.0
-----------------------------------------------

Sean Boisen / SemanticBible.
https://semanticbible.com/cgi/cgi-view.html
https://semanticbible.com/license.html
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/

355 story units covering 3,779 Gospel verses. Adaptations: expansion to verse
level, colour classification, interface presentation, and correction of unit
102's source typo from Matt.4.33 to Mark.4.33. The index and the adapted index
data retain this licence, including its non-commercial restriction.


3. Cross-references — CC BY
---------------------------

OpenBible.info, snapshot of 26 October 2026.
https://www.openbible.info/labs/cross-references/

344,799 source records were ingested; the 44,469 originating in the four
Gospels are included. The source votes order the links; they are not
similarity scores.


4. Scripture texts
------------------

Public domain:
  American Standard Version 1901, supplied through
    https://github.com/scrollmapper/bible_databases
  World English Bible and seven further public-domain editions, through
    https://free.bible/developers/
  Japanese Kougo 1954/1955, structured text through scrollmapper; edition
    provenance also listed by Free.Bible.

Indian Revised Version — © Bridge Connectivity Solutions Pvt. Ltd.,
CC BY-SA 4.0. Hindi: © 2017, 2018, 2019; Bengali: © 2018, 2019;
Marathi, Punjabi, Tamil, Telugu: © 2017, 2019.
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  https://ebible.org/hin2017/copyright.htm
  https://ebible.org/benirv/copyright.htm
  https://ebible.org/mar/copyright.htm
  https://ebible.org/pan/copyright.htm
  https://ebible.org/tam2017/copyright.htm
  https://ebible.org/tel2017/copyright.htm
  Structured text mirror: https://github.com/thiagobodruk/bible
Gospel extracts and formatting contributions retain CC BY-SA 4.0 separately
from the Gospel index. Layout was changed; separately supplied headings and
footnotes may be omitted. No machine translation was used. No source
publisher's endorsement is implied.

ESV and NASB texts are NOT included in this project. Those editions open in an
external reader under the publishers' own terms.
  https://www.crossway.org/permissions/
  https://www.lockman.org/permission-to-quote-copyright-trademark-information/


